raw `
@ Labels that only belonged to deleted Hoenn maps. Unreachable Emerald systems
@ (Battle Frontier, Battle Pyramid, Trainer Hill, match calls, Hoenn-only field
@ events) still name them, so they are kept here as empty stand-ins until those
@ systems are deleted. Remove a label when nothing names it any more, and this
@ file once it is empty. See include/constants/removed_maps.h for the matching
@ map, layout and object constants.

	.align 2
@ Scripts
BattleFrontier_BattlePike_EventScript_CloseCurtain::
BattleFrontier_BattlePyramid_EventScript_WarpToLobbyLost::
